## What We Are Building

Plan-driven anchor-pair video generation pipeline for SandyStudio S15-E01. The flow:
Storyboarder → Designer (SPC-ref_plan) → EREF Critic → Reference Artist (anchor pair start/end IMG) → Director approve → Animator (SPC-shot_plan) → Video Designer's Critic → Director approve → VGEN single-shot (Seedance img2vid with start+end conditioning).

This was the first session where the full anchor-mode chain ran in production. The morning landed v08 anchor pair SH09 with all three canon characters (Sandy hourglass, Anvil character, Mirror_vanity hero prop) locking correctly — first time ever in anchor mode. Afternoon was a cascade: every downstream stage exposed a different system gap, fixed in commit-by-commit sequence.

The bigger system goal: every Director Plan decision (provider/quality/orbit/end-image) must propagate end-to-end to Seedance via the runner reading Plan body — not lost to legacy fallback. Plus visibility of every auto-chain stage in Activity Feed so Director can see real-time progress.

---

## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **SH09 v08 anchor pair start + end** — confirmed by: Director visual review «1-4 OK», all three canon (Sandy = hourglass not bear, Anvil = character with face/arms, Mirror_vanity = centred oval trumeau) preserved. First P2.3 production success.
- **TD-65a preamble soften = root cause for Sandy → squirrel regression** — confirmed by: my direct OpenAI /v1/images/edits test (`scripts/manual-sh09-direct-api.ts`) with softened preamble + identical refs produced perfect Sandy hourglass on first try. Then runner v08 matched empirically after TD-65a landed on master.
- **TD-66 file_type widen** — confirmed by: 11/11 animator-critic tests pass, including new regression test for `SPC-shot_plan-<shot_id>` form.
- **TD-67a four-alias allowlist restored** — confirmed by: 22/22 animator tests pass after revert; `seedance-standard` re-added per Director directive q49b 2026-05-24 («почему до сих пор нет seedance-standard»).
- **TD-69 agent_started telemetry for VGEN** — confirmed by: factory.ts:232 pattern replicated in `execVgenStart` + `execVgenSingleShot` insert-job-row steps; tsc clean; emits include shot_id + plan_asset_id metadata.
- **TD-61 schema declares planAssetId** — confirmed by: tsc clean; approve-route at line 548 already passes `planAssetId: asset.id`, runner at lines 1807-1906 already has plan-driven branch — schema declaration was the only missing link to let the field through Inngest EventSchemas.
- **TD-68 orbit + ACTION beat policy** — confirmed by: tsc clean, 11/11 critic tests pass, new V11+V12 checks added to `agents/exec/animator_critic.md`, Worked Example comparison added to `agents/exec/animator.md`.
- **9 commits on master since session start** — confirmed by: `git log origin/master --oneline -10` shows `3ed7f03 → 7fadd2e → e5e1a78 → 1bf8e4f → 11a1d27 → 676a6c5 → 824357c → c9cccbb → 27072a8`.

