## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **TD-65 ref order revert (Sandy slot 1 → slot N)** — failed because: SH09 v07 still rendered Sandy as squirrel after revert. Diagnostic outcome matrix showed «Sandy squirrel + mirror centred → root cause deeper than ref order». Slot position was not the variable.
- **TD-67 (remove seedance-standard from allowlist)** — failed because: Director explicitly wanted it kept. Reverted via TD-67a commit `676a6c5`. Lesson: I misinterpreted Polина's «Current allowed choices are X, Y, Z» as permission to retire the alias; Director's earlier q49b 2026-05-24 directive specifically added it.
- **Prompt reinforcement for Sandy (v06 with stronger SUBJECT 1 wording)** — failed because: Director observed «опять белка». Provider was hard-attending slot 1 LAYOUT LOCK preamble regardless of prompt body strength. Could not be fixed by prompt body alone — required preamble soften.
- **Manual UI form workaround (paste anchor v08 asset IDs into END FRAME + REFERENCE IMAGE)** — Director explicitly rejected this approach: «не давать советы исправить вручную я могу это сделать это не сложно но это не улучшит качество нашей системы». Lesson recorded.
- **TD-61 fix landed BUT SH<N> v01-v06 retroactively** — VID-shot v01 06:44 UTC was generated BEFORE TD-61 landed on master. Director's «всё висит в воздухе» observation traced to legacy fallback prompt + no start/end conditioning. Post-TD-61 the schema lets planAssetId through; legacy assets stay as-is, future ones get plan-driven path.

